meta {
  name: List my categories
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/categories
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  TICKET-P6-003 — every `UserCategory` row the caller has materialised (seed-originated or custom), each
  with how many of their own ratings currently carry it. `requireAuth` only — works for an anonymous
  session too.

  A seed (see `constants/categorySeeds.ts`) the caller has never picked simply has no row here — there is
  nothing to filter.

  Response: 200, an array of `{ id, name, slug, isSeed, createdAt, ratingCount }`.
}
